 <h2>Foundation<br>Privacy Policy</h2>

    <div class="privacy-text">
    <p>This Privacy Policy ("Policy") outlines how Lifespring Design ("we", "us") collects, uses, and safeguards information accessed through the Foundation platform.</p>
    <p>This Policy applies to authorized users of the Foundation platform.</p>

    <h4>Information We Collect</h4>
    <p>We collect business contact information, customer records, notes, and operational data entered by users. Authentication data is handled through our identity provider.</p>

    <h4>How We Use Information</h4>
    <p>Information is used to provide platform functionality, support customer operations, and improve the service. We do not sell user data.</p>

    <h4>Third-Party Integrations</h4>
    <p>When enabled, integrations such as QuickBooks access only the data required for the integration to function. Users authorize third-party connections directly.</p>

    <h4>Data Security</h4>
    <p>We take reasonable measures to protect the security and confidentiality of collected information, including access controls and encrypted connections where applicable.</p>

    <h4>Data Retention</h4>
    <p>Information is retained in accordance with applicable legal requirements and organizational data retention policies.</p>

    <h4>Policy Updates</h4>
    <p>We may update this Policy from time to time. Authorized users will be notified of significant changes.</p>

    <h4>Contact</h4>
    <p>For questions or concerns regarding this Policy, contact Lifespring Design.</p>
